# libwayland-client, libEGL and the Vulkan loader are opened with dlopen()
# by winit/wgpu, so they carry no DT_NEEDED entry and ${shlibs:Depends}
# cannot see them: without these the package installs and then fails at
# startup. libxkbcommon0 is dlopen'd too but is already picked up because
# the binary also links it directly.
Depends: ${misc:Depends}, ${shlibs:Depends},
 libwayland-client0,
 libegl1,
 libvulkan1
Description: Kanban boards for the COSMIC desktop, with panel applet
 KanBone is a Kanban board for the COSMIC desktop built on libcosmic:
 cards are kept in a local SQLite database and a companion panel applet
 adds a card without leaving the current window. Card states are shown
 as words as well as markers and every move is reachable from the
 keyboard, not only by dragging.
 .
 This package ships both binaries (kanban-app, kanban-applet), their
 desktop entries, AppStream metainfo and icons. A running COSMIC session
 is required at runtime: the applet is loaded by cosmic-panel and the
 application expects a Wayland compositor.
